useums, my son is bored.</div>","choices":[{"id":13934,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>take</span>"},{"id":13935,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>watch</span>"},{"id":13936,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>visit</span>"},{"id":13937,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>wear</span>"},{"id":13938,"letter":"E.","html":"<span>send</span>"}]},{"id":7864,"num":"8","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>We don't _____ TV very often</div>","choices":[{"id":13939,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>take</span>"},{"id":13940,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>watch</span>"},{"id":13941,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>visit</span>"},{"id":13942,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>wear</span>"},{"id":13943,"letter":"E.","html":"<span>send</span>"}]},{"id":7865,"num":"9","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I _____ glasses.</div>","choices":[{"id":13944,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>take</span>"},{"id":13945,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>watch</span>"},{"id":13946,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>visit</span>"},{"id":13947,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>wear</span>"},{"id":13948,"letter":"E.","html":"<span>send</span>"}]},{"id":7866,"num":"10","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I hardly ever _____ emails.</div>","choices":[{"id":13949,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>take</span>"},{"id":13950,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>watch</span>"},{"id":13951,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>visit</span>"},{"id":13952,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>wear</span>"},{"id":13953,"letter":"E.","html":"<span>send</span>"}]}]},{"id":929,"questions":[{"id":7846,"num":"","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p class=\"double-line-height\">Every morning, I wake up early and <span class=\"numBox\">1</span> <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> to work. Before leaving, I always <span class=\"numBox\">2</span> <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> a cup of coffee to start my day. After work, I like to <span class=\"numBox\">3</span> <span data-gap=\"2\"></span> some exercise to stay healthy. Sometimes, I <span class=\"numBox\">4</span> <span data-gap=\"3\"></span> football with my friends in the park and other times, I <span class=\"numBox\">5</span> <span data-gap=\"4\"></span> the guitar at home to relax. </p> <p class=\"double-line-height\">In the evenings, I usually <span class=\"numBox\">6</span> <span data-gap=\"5\"></span> to bed around 10:30 pm. Before sleeping, I often <span class=\"numBox\">7</span> <span data-gap=\"6\"></span> a book. On weekends, I spend time with my family. We often <span class=\"numBox\">8</span> <span data-gap=\"7\"></span> dinner together while we <span class=\"numBox\">9</span> <span data-gap=\"8\"></span> to music. Then, we eat and we <span class=\"numBox\">10</span> <span data-gap=\"9\"></span> TV. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}